    "weekly_field": "Value of a weekly_metrics column. agg=mean averages rows in scope, agg=sum adds them, agg=team_distinct_sum adds each team's value once.",
    "event_count": "Number of event records in scope matching 'where'.",
    "event_ratio": "100 * count(numerator) / count(denominator) over event records in scope (pooled, not an average of rates). None when the denominator is 0.",
    "event_mean": "Mean of an event field over records in scope. None when there are no records."
  },
